  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "229cbca0-38c6-474d-98da-a4c7af7d1568"],
 " runs from ",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 " to ",
 StyleBox["q", "TI"],
 ". A member of a circle is a cyclic vertex list, its first vertex not \
repeated, and is recognised up to rotation and direction."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"58ac9709-d5d2-4fd3-8056-21772b82f5d0"],

Cell[TextData[{
